Bundle-Name: Gecko Weather GRIB2
Bundle-Description: Reading DWD GRIB2 files through netCDF-Java from memory — one or several \
	records on a plain latitude/longitude grid — and writing minimal ones for tests. Shared by the \
	gridded DWD providers (ICON-D2, UV index); no provider knowledge.

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.gecko.weather.model;version=snapshot,\
	org.gecko.weather.api;version=snapshot,\
	org.gecko.ucar.netcdf;version=snapshot
